WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.520
Hi CBeebies friends, it's me Joe Wicks here and&nbsp;
guess what? It's World Cup time! I am so excited!&nbsp;

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:13.280
Do you want to join me and my good friend&nbsp;
Duggee for a really fun World Cup warm-up?&nbsp;

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:18.160
Well come on then, let's get going! Make sure&nbsp;
you've got lots of space around you because we're&nbsp;

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:23.200
going to be doing some really big moves. Why not&nbsp;
grab your grown-ups and get them to join in too?&nbsp;

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:29.120
Are you ready? In three, two,&nbsp;
one, let's kicky kicky kick kick!&nbsp;

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:34.160
First up, we've got knee smashes. Reach your hands&nbsp;
up nice and high above your head and smash that&nbsp;

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:39.019
knee into your hands. Off we go. Kick! 
Let's kicky, kicky, kick, kick.

00:00:39.721 --> 00:00:41.440
Stretch and drive.
Kick, kick, kick, kick.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:44.965
Knees up high. Come on.&nbsp;
Kicky, kicky, kick, kick.

00:00:44.965 --> 00:00:49.677
Kick, kick, kick, kick.

00:00:49.677 --> 00:00:52.882
Kicky, kicky, kick.
Kick! Kick! Kick!

00:00:52.882 --> 00:00:58.696
Last few seconds. In three,  two, one, and rest.

00:00:58.696 --> 00:01:01.720
Perfect. Next exercise,
toe taps.

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:04.610
 Feet nice and wide.
Arms up by your side. 

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:09.302
Then we're going to tap those toes.
Left to right. Off we go. 

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:14.116
And kick, kick, kick.&nbsp;
Kicky, kicky, kick, kick. 

00:01:14.116 --> 00:01:17.788
Kick, kick. Touching those&nbsp;
toes, you're doing great.

00:01:18.866 --> 00:01:20.720
Keep moving. 

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:27.520
Come on, it's the World Cup.&nbsp;
Left to right. Last few seconds.&nbsp;

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:35.840
In three, two, one and rest. Fantastic.
Third and final exercise, we've got kickers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:41.440
We're going to kick our foot out in front. So kick,
kick. Nice and high! Take your time. Let's go.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:44.174
Kick, kick, kick.

00:01:50.137 --> 00:01:53.628
Kick, kick, kick.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:02:00.475
Three, two, one. Fantastic! 
Great work,&nbsp;everybody.

00:02:00.475 --> 00:02:02.949
A-woof! That was lots of fun, wasn't it? 

00:02:02.949 --> 00:02:08.640
Are you nice and warmed up now? Me&nbsp;too. 
Thank you so much for joining me for my epic&nbsp;

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:12.560
football warm-up. We have definitely earned our&nbsp;
Football Badge, haven't we? You can practice these&nbsp;

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:18.960
moves and loads more in my brand new Football&nbsp;
Activate episode on CBeebies and BBC iPlayer.

